3","dur":22.91,"text":"« C’est ta faute ! » dit Kiko. « Non, c’est la tienne ! » répond Nuna. Ils se tournent le dos. Kiko s’en va sur un bloc de glace, Nuna sur un autre. Chacun boude dans son coin, les ailes croisées. Le vent souffle, froid et gris. Il n’y a plus de rires sur la banquise.","words":[0.12,0.12,0.44,0.715,1.57,1.57,1.57,1.89,3.03,3.03,3.455,3.58,3.805,4.79,4.79,4.79,5.315,6.37,6.72,6.97,7.32,7.545,8.48,9.005,9.255,9.48,9.68,9.805,10.105,10.255,11.205,11.605,11.83,12.03,13.22,13.845,14.12,14.32,14.57,15.145,15.395,15.595,16.79,17.115,17.415,18.015,18.34,18.465,19.65,19.955,20.105,20.255,20.48,20.705,21.08,21.305,21.48],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.29,"grin"],[0.54,"open"],[0.615,"smile"],[0.74,"small"],[0.79,"smile"],[0.89,"o"],[1.04,"grin"],[1.255,"smile"],[1.715,"grin"],[2.215,"smile"],[2.315,"o"],[2.515,"smile"],[3.18,"grin"],[3.28,"o"],[3.405,"smile"],[3.48,"grin"],[3.655,"open"],[3.83,"grin"],[3.98,"smile"],[4.08,"grin"],[4.475,"smile"],[4.915,"grin"],[5.09,"small"],[5.19,"o"],[5.49,"grin"],[5.565,"smile"],[5.665,"open"],[5.855,"smile"],[6.47,"grin"],[7.095,"o"],[7.17,"grin"],[7.62,"smile"],[7.72,"o"],[7.965,"smile"],[8.53,"grin"],[8.805,"smile"],[8.88,"o"],[9.03,"grin"],[9.105,"open"],[9.28,"small"],[9.38,"open"],[9.505,"grin"],[9.555,"o"],[9.605,"grin"],[9.705,"o"],[9.88,"grin"],[9.955,"o"],[10.03,"grin"],[10.405,"smile"],[10.53,"open"],[10.705,"grin"],[11.03,"smile"],[11.23,"grin"],[11.305,"o"],[11.38,"grin"],[11.43,"smile"],[11.505,"open"],[11.63,"grin"],[11.855,"o"],[11.955,"grin"],[12.055,"smile"],[12.155,"o"],[12.305,"grin"],[12.705,"smile"],[13.37,"grin"],[13.47,"open"],[13.57,"grin"],[13.695,"o"],[13.87,"small"],[13.97,"o"],[14.045,"grin"],[14.195,"open"],[14.345,"grin"],[14.42,"o"],[14.595,"grin"],[14.67,"o"],[14.72,"smile"],[14.795,"grin"],[14.87,"smile"],[15.17,"grin"],[15.745,"o"],[15.82,"open"],[15.92,"grin"],[15.995,"smile"],[16.07,"grin"],[16.275,"smile"],[16.94,"grin"],[17.14,"small"],[17.19,"smile"],[17.265,"open"],[17.44,"grin"]